Resettlement Scheme;
(g)
to submit the draft Rehabilitation and Resettlement Scheme to the Collector;
(h)
to publish the approved Rehabilitation and Resettlement Scheme in the affected area;
(i)
to help and assist the Collector in prepairing the Rehabilitation and Resettlement award;
(j)
to monitor and supervise the progress in Rehabilitation and Resettlement study;
(k)
to assist in post implementation audit of Rehabilitation and Resettlement; and
(l)
any other work required to be done for Rehabilitation and Resettlement.
